# runner (Linux, Python 3.14 -- the author's local version since v3.10.1, so
# local test runs match CI), ignoring anything published in the two weeks
# before the lock date. Then check the lock against known advisories
# (osv.dev). Regenerate after changing a pin:
#   uv pip compile requirements-ci.in --python-version 3.14 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu --generate-hashes \
#     --exclude-newer <today minus 14 days> -o requirements-ci.txt
